godot/pull/100763.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-30T15:08:06Z"},"body":"Currently, with a composition layer that uses hole punching, changing `visible` (to hide/show the composition layer) won't have an effect most of the time.\r\n\r\nThis is due to some old logic that is checking if the `fallback` node exists or not to see if we are using real composition layers (versus a fallback for OpenXR runtimes that don't support them). However, after we added the hole punching feature (in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91485), this logic no longer makes sense, because we are using the fallback mesh to setup hole punching as well.\r\n\r\nSo, this PR switches to checking `is_natively_supported()` instead, which is working in my testing","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100763/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100763/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":n